'''Clemont''' (Japanese: '''シトロン''' ''Citron'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Put 2 random cards from among {{TCGP|Magneton}}, {{TCGP|Heliolisk}}, and {{TCGP|Clemont's Backpack}} from your deck into your hand.
}}

