==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Clemont}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Clemont]] is the [[Gym Leader]] of the [[Lumiose Gym]].
*{{p|Magneton}} and {{p|Heliolisk}} are Pokémon that Clemont uses in {{g|X and Y}}.

